  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "key": "skill.1410.description",
    "text": "举起旗枪，为队友施加<style=\"accent-gn\">激励</style>。随后可施加二段追击奋力跃入敌阵，对范围内的敌方目标造成<style=\"physical\">物理伤害</style>并将其<style=\"accent-gn\">击飞</style>，同时回复<style=\"accent-gn\">100</style>点<style=\"accent-gn\">勇气</style>。<br><style=\"accent-gn\">激励</style>：持续<style=\"accent-gn\">10</style>秒，期间所有队友急速+<style=\"accent-gn\">10%</style>，自身每<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>秒回复<style=\"accent-gn\">10</style><style=\"accent-gn\">勇气</style>每<style=\"accent-gn\">2</style>秒回复<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>层<style=\"accent-gn\">锐利</style>。<br><i><style=\"text_third_gray\">「无尽风暴，随吾骑士之令而解锁强大之力！风啊，以汹涌疾驰昭示汝之荣耀！在风中显现吧！」</style></i><br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">攻略：勇气较低时施放。</style></size>",
    "availability": [
      {
        "deployment_id": "global",
        "channel": "steam",
        "client_build": "24252055"
      }
    ],
    "provenance": {
      "source": "official-game-localization",
      "reference": "client-build:global/steam/24252055#localization-1505341103",
      "confidence": "verified"
    }
  },
  {
    "schema_version": 2,
    "locale": "zh-CN",
    "key": "skill.1430.description",
    "text": "将自身的<style=\"accent-gn\">勇气</style>转换为持续的风场，对周围目标造成<style=\"physical\">物理伤害</style>，伤害间隔受到攻击速度属性影响，直到<style=\"accent-gn\">勇气</style>消散，每<style=\"accent-gn\">1</style>秒消耗<style=\"accent-gn\">16</style>点<style=\"accent-gn\">勇气</style>，再次点击可关闭技能。<br><br><size=22><style=\"tipsYellow\">攻略：尽可能使得勇气风环的持续时间最大化，除了在勇气满额时施放外施放过程中要通过一定的手段回复勇气。</style></size>",
